{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ会場で発売になった\n浴衣生写真♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー大阪\nありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこ焼きたこ焼き♡\nたこ焼きマントマーン☆～（ゝ。∂）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残り4箇所♡\n普段なかなか会いに行けない\n地域の方にも会えるのが\nすごい楽しみです(   ´ω`   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーに関しての感想は\n神宮が終わってから全部書きます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋ウォーズカップ\n芸能界最強決定戦2を\nご覧頂きありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとか勝つことが出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は矢倉囲いというのをしましたが\nやはり私は振り飛車の美濃囲いの方が\nやりやすいかなあ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ試してみようと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザブングル加藤さんやつるのさんも\nまたたくさん\nアドバイスしてくださったので\nここから更に強くなりたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにあれから将棋ウォーズ五級に\n昇級しました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四級への道のりは\nまだまだ険しそうです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋はこれからも続けて行きます♡\n将棋すごく楽しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日ごと)\nの方のみ僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8.19 birthday!!!!!!\nきゃしーさん\n千賀なつきさん\nnippataroさん\nくらげちゃんさん\nはむぱんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日次回予告 9月1日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここ、私の号泣シーンは\nやはり顔がひどすぎたのか\n写ってなかったよー☆～（ゝ。∂）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにルーピングスターシップ\nっていう乗り物での出来事です(笑)\n本当に苦手なんだコレ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集計はちょい待ち～(   ´ω`   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/08/19/2453331/